From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the events the attributes replaced go

The desktop's state is attributes with bare `<name>changed` events, and
its asks return promises, so the events that carried the same payloads
-- `appappeared` and the other seven `app*`, `focuschanged`, `modifiers`,
`files`, `filepreview`, `apps`, `battery`, `clipboard`, `theme`,
`windowstheme`, `idle`, `locked`, `extensions`, `tray`, `notifications`,
`audio` and `shellconfig` -- leave the module, and their IDL and
generated bindings leave the lists here.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 .../blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni       | 64 ---------
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni     | 32 -----
 2 files changed, 96 deletions(-)

